@startuml sequence_detailed
title Detailed Sequence Diagram – Flight Booking (Developer View)

actor Customer
participant "Web App\n(React)" as WA
participant "API Server\n(Node.js)" as API
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Payment Gateway\n(Stripe)" as PG
participant "Notification Service\n(Mailer)" as NS

== Authentication ==
Customer -> WA : Enter credentials
WA -> API : POST /api/auth/login\n{email, password}
API -> DB : SELECT user WHERE email = ?
DB --> API : User record
API --> WA : 200 OK {JWT token}
WA --> Customer : Redirect to search page

== Flight Search ==
Customer -> WA : Enter search params\n(origin, dest, date, passengers)
WA -> API : GET /api/flights\n?origin=&destination=&date=&seats=
API -> DB : SELECT flights WHERE origin=? AND destination=?\nAND date=? AND available_seats >= ?
DB --> API : List of flight records
API --> WA : 200 OK {flights: [...]}
WA --> Customer : Render flight listings

== Seat Selection & Booking Initiation ==
Customer -> WA : Select flight + seat(s)
WA -> API : GET /api/flights/{flightId}/seats
API -> DB : SELECT seats WHERE flight_id=? AND status='available'
DB --> API : Seat map data
API --> WA : 200 OK {seats: [...]}
WA --> Customer : Display seat map
Customer -> WA : Choose seat(s) + enter passenger info
WA -> API : POST /api/bookings/initiate\n{flightId, seatIds, passengers, userId}
API -> DB : UPDATE seats SET status='reserved'\nWHERE seat_id IN (?) — temp hold
DB --> API : Rows updated
API --> WA : 200 OK {bookingSession, totalAmount}
WA --> Customer : Show payment page

== Payment ==
Customer -> WA : Enter payment details
WA -> API : POST /api/payments\n{bookingSession, cardToken, amount}
API -> PG : POST /v1/charges\n{amount, currency, source: cardToken}
PG --> API : 200 OK {chargeId, status: "succeeded"}

== Booking Confirmation ==
API -> DB : INSERT INTO bookings\n(userId, flightId, seatIds, amount, transactionId)
API -> DB : UPDATE seats SET status='booked' WHERE seat_id IN (?)
DB --> API : Booking record created
API -> NS : POST /notify\n{userId, email, bookingId, eTicketData}
NS --> Customer : Email: E-ticket + booking confirmation
API --> WA : 200 OK {bookingId, eTicketUrl}
WA --> Customer : Display confirmation page + download link

== Payment Failure Handling ==
note over API, PG #ffaaaa
  If PG returns failure:
  API -> DB : UPDATE seats SET status='available'
  API --> WA : 402 Payment Failed {reason}
  WA --> Customer : Show error, allow retry
end note

@enduml
